| `uv mod 4 = b(1 + 2[N ≡ 1 mod 16])`; `s mod 64` determined by `(N mod 64, ε, QR_2)` | `N ≡ 1 (mod 8)` | 442 | 3 418 | 0 |
| mod-64 formula | `N ≡ 5 (mod 8)` | 460 | 3 483 | 0 |
| `T ∈ Cl(−4N)² ⇔ (2/p)=(2/q)=1` | `p ≡ q (mod 4)` | 902 | 6 901 | 0 |
